  "description": "【Stability Electric System】 Our trike come with 36V/13AH lithium battery and 350W stable motor; Supports max speed up to 15mph, Endurance mileage reach a range of 25miles(E-Bike Mode) to 35miles (Assisted Mode). Equipped with smart lithium battery charger for fast charging (4-5 hrs). Enough for most commuting tasks and most short trips.\n【Comfortable Riding】Designed with 24-inch wheels and adjustable seat tube&handle stem, this electric tirke is suitable for those 4'11\" to 6'2\" in height. Also, this adult tricycle equiped with SHIMANO 7 gears, that will provide a comfortable riding for senior, men and women.\n【Low Step-Through Frame】The height of down tube is 15''(38cm), it will be easily to get on this adult tricycle, easpecially for the elderly people and disabled people.\n【Cargo Basket】DWMEIGI provide a oversize cargo basket for this electric tricycle, 19''x 15''x 10'' (49x39x25cm), that's will be convenient for shopping, picnic, camping, pets, etc.\n【Easy to Use】There's no more extra functions on this tricycle, you will need to control the power on/off, PAS level, twist throttle and LED lights only.",
